=== R1: disk bomb vs --storage 3 ===
Starting ephemeral machine (vm-6069d079)...
2990+0 records out
3135815680 bytes (2.9GB) copied, 7.302390 seconds, 409.5MB/s
none                      2.9G      2.9G         0 100% /
::: RESULT FAIL R1-storage-cap — rc=0 host_delta=2947MB
(Assertion was too brittle — the cap WORKED: dd stopped at 2.9GB with the
 guest filesystem 100% full; the ENOSPC line fell outside the captured tail
 and rc=0 because the trailing df succeeded. --storage bounds guest writes.)

