=== R3: guest mount inventory with -v in:ro out:rw ===
virtiofs mounts crossing the VM boundary (deduplicated — the container mount
namespace shows the same two shares at several paths):
  smolvm0 /in  virtiofs ro,sync,relatime
  smolvm1 /out virtiofs rw,sync,relatime
everything else is guest-local:
  / = overlayfs (upper on /storage, backed by /dev/vda = the storage disk)
  /workspace, /storage = ext4 on /dev/vda
  /tmp /run /dev/shm = tmpfs; /proc /sys /dev standard
::: RESULT PASS R3-mounts — virtiofs shares present for /in and /out

